I can't cook and this is my cooking show."

40
00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:15.553
You know?
(audience laughing)

41
00:01:15.553 --> 00:01:18.170
Okay, well, this is a perfect segue.

42
00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:19.990
