47
00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:32.230 line:15%
Hey, Savannah. I heard that you are learning how to cook.

48
00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:34.710 line:15%
Hurray! Congratulations.

49
00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:37.700
So, I have a little bit of a question for you.

50
00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:39.720
Maybe a quiz you could say.

51
00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:42.340
The first thing that I teach people when I teach them

52
00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.890
how to cook is the term, "Mise En Place."

53
00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:47.710 line:15%
Drew, do you remember what this means

54
00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:50.030 line:15%
