89
00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:00.047 line:15%
What kind of knife is this mhm?

90
00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:01.860 line:15%
What do you think?

91
00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.523 line:15%
Is it a serrated knife or paring knife?

92
00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.620
That is a serrated knife.

93
00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.960
That is the knife that I cut myself

94
00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.630
on the pre-sliced English muffin.

95
00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.830
I know that knife anywhere.

96
00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.520
You know that knife intimately.

97
00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:16.353
Yes.
All right.

98
00:03:16.353 --> 00:03:18.490
Did she get it right, Geoffrey Zakarian?

99
00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:19.323
Amazing.

100
00:03:19.323 --> 00:03:21.640 line:15%
The answer is, of course it's serrated.

101
00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:24.400
Great for tomatoes and bread,

102
00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:25.760 line:15%
