103
00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:28.240
They're uncut and baguettes, crunchy bread.

104
00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.073
It's perfect.

105
00:03:29.073 --> 00:03:30.630
Don't use it on steak or chicken.

106
00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:33.020
It tears the meat. It's a big no-no.

107
00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.460
But for tomatoes and bread of all sorts, it's perfect.

108
00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:37.905
Cheers to cooking.

109
00:03:37.905 --> 00:03:39.600
(audience applauding and cheering)

110
00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:42.010
