119
00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:10.730 line:15%
And the water should always be at a full rolling boil.

120
00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.723 line:15%
Is it oil, A.

121
00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.733 line:15%
Or B, salt.

122
00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:18.930
Now I'm doubting myself.
(audience applauding)

123
00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.940
