126
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.970
So, maybe you should also put in oil?

127
00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:32.770
I think it's A or B.

128
00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.870
Well, if I have to say, then I'm just gonna go with salt

129
00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:37.390
