130
00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:38.847
And the correct answer is?

131
00:04:38.847 --> 00:04:40.331
It's gonna be C.
Salt.

132
00:04:40.331 --> 00:04:41.414
Yeah!
Yeah!

133
00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:45.030 line:15%
It's only opportunity you get to season the past itself

134
00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:48.290 line:15%
